{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "note": "プトレマイオス『地理学』の地図の語彙と、『アルマゲスト』の星図の語彙を対にした。", "read_id": "READ-20261025-f11771", "reading": "contested", "session_id": "SESSION-20261025-9c4e7a", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-dcd95f", "type": "material"}}
